# Superpowers skill compatibility pointer

Use this rule only when a task selects the Superpowers workflow. It does not
make Superpowers mandatory for every task.

## Available implementations

- `superpowers:using-superpowers`
- Native source: the installed Superpowers skill named `superpowers:using-superpowers`
- Portable fallback: `.agents/skills/using-superpowers.md`

## Rule

When the Superpowers workflow is selected, use the native skill when available;
otherwise use the portable fallback. For other tasks, follow the applicable
task-specific skill or repository guidance. Local skill cache paths are
environment-specific and must not be treated as the only source of truth.

User instructions remain the highest priority.
